            "text": "<p>SKIN RESIST is Cantabria Labs’ advanced dermatological skincare range developed for sensitive, reactive and redness-prone skin. Featuring exclusive AQUAMMUNIST® Technology, its expert formulations help soothe discomfort, reduce visible redness, strengthen the skin barrier and improve skin resilience, while supporting the prevention and reduction of visible signs of ageing.</p>"
