        "heading_bUrEDg": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Introducing AQUAMMUNIST® Technology",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_FY6JrH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the science of the hydrobiome, AQUAMMUNIST® combines <strong>mineral-rich Solía Thermal Spring Water</strong> from Cantabria with <strong>encapsulated <em>Phaeodactylum tricornutum</em> microalgae extract</strong> to help calm skin reactivity and support the skin’s natural defences.</p>\n<p>Laboratory research has demonstrated the potential of AQUAMMUNIST® to <b>help protect skin cells against factors associated with sensitivity and reactivity</b>.<sup>3</sup></p>\n<p class=\"caption-with-letter-spacing caption-with-letter-spacing--medium\"></p>\n<p>Clinical research on formulations combining AQUAMMUNIST®, cherimoya extract and niacinamide (as found in SKIN RESIST products) <b>demonstrated significant reductions in itching and burning sensations following exposure to external triggers, alongside improvements in skin sensitivity and resistance</b>.<sup>4</sup></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
