            "title": "",
            "text": "<p class=\"caption-with-letter-spacing caption-with-letter-spacing--medium\"><strong>Step 1 | Cleanse · AM &amp; PM</strong></p>\n<h3>SKIN RESIST Velvet Cleanser</h3>\n<p>Gently removes impurities while respecting the skin barrier, helping prepare sensitive-reactive skin for targeted treatment and moisturising care.</p>",
