        "heading_size": "h1",
        "richtext": "<p>SKIN RESIST Velvet Cleanser, Daily Fluid and Sensage Serum work together to provide gentle cleansing, targeted calming and daily barrier support. Formulated with AQUAMMUNIST® Technology and complementary dermatological ingredients, the SKIN RESIST regime helps reduce skin reactivity and visible redness, improve comfort and address visible signs of ageing.</p>",
