    "collapsible_content_mRYtCq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_QM4yUP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is sensitive & reactive skin?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Sensitive & reactive skin is more prone to discomfort, redness and sensations such as itching, tingling or stinging in response to everyday triggers. It is often associated with a weakened skin barrier, which can make skin more vulnerable to external stressors.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_k9NYhm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is AQUAMMUNIST® Technology?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>AQUAMMUNIST® is Cantabria Labs' exclusive hydrobiome-inspired technology combining mineral-rich thermal spring water and microalgae extract. It is designed to help calm skin reactivity and improve skin resilience.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xUADNf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does SKIN RESIST help reduce visible redness?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>SKIN RESIST combines AQUAMMUNIST® Technology with complementary calming and barrier-supporting ingredients including Cherimoya Extract and Niacinamide to help reduce skin reactivity and visible redness. Clinical studies of the complete regime have demonstrated significant improvements from 14 days.⁵</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yxU7hJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is SKIN RESIST suitable for daily use?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. SKIN RESIST features fragrance-free formulations dermatologically tested on sensitive skin, with excellent tolerability demonstrated when used as part of a daily skincare regime.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wxLnq6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can SKIN RESIST help address signs of ageing?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. In addition to calming and barrier-supporting care, the range incorporates ingredients that help address visible signs of ageing. Clinical studies of the regime demonstrated improvements in firmness, elasticity and wrinkle depth.⁵</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_XyTMmx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why is daily photoprotection important for reactive and redness-prone skin?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>UV exposure is a common trigger for sensitive-reactive skin and can contribute to visible redness. Daily photoprotection helps defend against UV exposure, making it an important part of a complete skincare routine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
